          "text": "```xml\n<mujoco model=\"basketball_hoop\">\n  <option timestep=\"0.002\" density=\"1.2\"/>\n\n  <visual>\n    <headlight ambient=\"0.15 0.15 0.15\" diffuse=\"0.3 0.3 0.3\" specular=\"0 0 0\"/>\n  </visual>\n\n  <worldbody>\n    <!-- Lighting: main overhead directional light plus a softer fill spot above the hoop -->\n    <light name=\"overhead_sun\" directional=\"true\" pos=\"2 0 10\" dir=\"0 0 -1\" diffuse=\"0.8 0.8 0.8\" specular=\"0.2 0.2 0.2\" castshadow=\"true\"/>\n    <light name=\"overhead_fill\" pos=\"4 0 8\" dir=\"0 0 -1\" diffuse=\"0.3 0.3 0.3\" specular=\"0 0 0\" castshadow=\"false\"/>\n\n    <!-- Floor: top surface at z = 0 -->\n    <geom name=\"floor\" type=\"plane\" pos=\"0 0 0\" size=\"10 10 0.1\" rgba=\"0.72 0.52 0.32 1\" friction=\"0.8 0.005 0.0001\"/>\n\n    <!-- Regulation size-7 basketball: circumference 0.75 m -> radius 0.1194 m, mass ~0.62 kg (hollow shell inertia 2/3 m r^2) -->\n    <body name=\"ball\" pos=\"0 0 0.1194\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball_free\"/>\n      <inertial pos=\"0 0 0\" mass=\"0.62\" diaginertia=\"0.005893 0.005893 0.005893\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.1194\" rgba=\"0.85 0.40 0.10 1\" friction=\"0.9 0.01 0.001\" solref=\"0.01 0.2\" fluidshape=\"ellipsoid\" fluidcoef=\"0.25 0.25 1.5 1.0 1.0\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <!-- Hoop: origin at rim center, 4 m along +x, rim at 3.05 m. Fixed to the world (no joint). -->\n    <body name=\"hoop\" pos=\"4 0 3.05\">\n      <!-- Rim: 16 capsule segments, inner diameter 0.4572 m (18 in), tube radius 0.008 m, tube-center radius 0.2366 m -->\n      <geom name=\"rim_00\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.2366 0 0 0.2186 0.0905 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_01\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.2186 0.0905 0 0.1673 0.1673 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_02\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.1673 0.1673 0 0.0905 0.2186 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_03\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.0905 0.2186 0 0 0.2366 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_04\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0 0.2366 0 -0.0905 0.2186 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_05\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"-0.0905 0.2186 0 -0.1673 0.1673 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_06\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"-0.1673 0.1673 0 -0.2186 0.0905 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_07\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"-0.2186 0.0905 0 -0.2366 0 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_08\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"-0.2366 0 0 -0.2186 -0.0905 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_09\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"-0.2186 -0.0905 0 -0.1673 -0.1673 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_10\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"-0.1673 -0.1673 0 -0.0905 -0.2186 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_11\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"-0.0905 -0.2186 0 0 -0.2366 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_12\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0 -0.2366 0 0.0905 -0.2186 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_13\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.0905 -0.2186 0 0.1673 -0.1673 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_14\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.1673 -0.1673 0 0.2186 -0.0905 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_15\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.2186 -0.0905 0 0.2366 0 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n\n      <!-- Bracket joining the back of the rim to the backboard face -->\n      <geom name=\"hoop_bracket\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0.3105 0 -0.01\" size=\"0.0705 0.05 0.012\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n\n      <!-- Backboard: 1.80 x 1.05 m, 0.03 m thick; front face 0.15 m behind the rim's inner edge (x = 0.381); bottom edge 0.15 m below rim -->\n      <geom name=\"backboard\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0.396 0 0.375\" size=\"0.015 0.9 0.525\" rgba=\"0.92 0.95 0.98 0.85\"/>\n      <!-- Target square painted on the backboard front (thin, visual only) -->\n      <geom name=\"backboard_square\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0.3805 0 0.145\" size=\"0.0005 0.295 0.225\" rgba=\"0.1 0.1 0.1 1\" contype=\"0\" conaffinity=\"0\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <!-- Support: floor plate, vertical pole behind the backboard, and horizontal arm to the backboard's back face (x = 4.411) -->\n    <body name=\"hoop_support\" pos=\"5.2 0 0\">\n      <geom name=\"support_base\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0 0 0.025\" size=\"0.4 0.4 0.025\" rgba=\"0.2 0.2 0.25 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"support_pole\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0 0 1.7\" size=\"0.1 0.1 1.7\" rgba=\"0.25 0.25 0.3 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"support_arm\" type=\"box\" pos=\"-0.4445 0 3.3\" size=\"0.3445 0.06 0.06\" rgba=\"0.25 0.25 0.3 1\"/>\n    </body>\n  </worldbody>\n\n  <keyframe>\n    <key name=\"shot\" qvel=\"2.88 0 10 0 0 0\"/>\n    <!-- Changed only shot qvel: reduced forward speed to 2.88 m/s and increased upward speed to 10 m/s, targeting the rim center on a steeper descent with air drag. The ball still launches from its resting position. -->\n  </keyframe>\n</mujoco>\n```",
